WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.002
The review queue: every place where the documentation and the network disagree.

2
00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:11.079
Findings are grouped by kind: IP requests, config compliance, SSH host keys, NAC.

3
00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:17.206
Each row says why it was flagged, and links to the device or the link it concerns.

4
00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:24.207
A ghost link: seen on the wire, missing from the documented topology.

5
00:00:24.207 --> 00:00:29.207
Back in the queue, you decide what is true: document it, or dismiss it.
